(D3 -- minimal repro. RESOLVED 2026-08-22: the manual's own worked
 example of a .lib file's format (then at LANGUAGE.md:5408-5414) showed
 a zero-parameter, no-return-type entry as bare `greet.` in the Table of
 Contents. The actual compiler always prefixed `To` for every entry,
 parameter-taking or not. The manual was corrected in vox commit
 70ca1c2 (now LANGUAGE.md:5408-5414) to show `To greet.`, matching.
 Re-ran 2026-08-22 against vox 0.4.9 (commit bb406de), from the repo root:
   VOX_CORE_PATH=/home/josj/scr/english/vox/coreasm
   /home/josj/scr/english/vox/target/release/vox
   docs/ledger/probes/libraries/shared/D3.vox --shared -o d4.so
   cat d4.lib
 expected output: exit 0, and d4.lib's Table of Contents reads
   Table of Contents:
       To greet.
 not the manual's
   Table of Contents:
       greet.
)
Library mathkit version "1.0".

To greet.
  Print "hello from mathkit".
